                                           "Gun: A legendary figure in ancient Chinese mythology. He was the father of Yu and the grandfather of Qi who is the founder of the Xia Dynasty.",
                                           "Ren: an ancient unit of measure in ancient China. The length of one ren varied slightly across dynasties and historical records. (One Ren鈮?.848 meters in Han dynasty)",
                                           "Yi Yin: whose personal name was Zhi, titled Yin (Chief Minister), was a pivotal figure spanning the late Xia and early Shang dynasties, renowned as the Shang dynasty鈥檚 founding statesman, politician, military strategist and philosopher.",
                                           "Zao Fu: surnamed Ying and of the Zhao clan, was a sixth-generation descendant of Fei Lian and a lineal descendant of Bo Yi, renowned in Chinese history as a master charioteer."
